{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach and grab it. Check its properties, move to destination. Else scan area and move. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />",
